        "tends": "Home instruction, private schooling, full-time online public schools, and approved alternative programs all satisfy the same duty. What differs from state to state is the reporting: some require notification and a portfolio review, some require standardized assessment, and a few require very little. The duty is to be educated in an approved way, not to sit in a particular building.",
